                                "sense_id": "a031768a-c69e-3f47-91f2-708be5ec112b",
                                "text": "Jeptha Billingsley, who was no prize pig himself (he had been arrested for horse theft and assault with intent to murder), was to be taught a lesson, and the vigilantes made him cut down the McLemores."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ab4167d-7ffa-4d41-a19c-3a18e94b78ac",
                                "sense_id": "a031768a-c69e-3f47-91f2-708be5ec112b",
                                "text": "According to the lawsuit, McLemore struggled with diagnosed schizophrenia and substance abuse and was in the midst of an “acute mental health crisis.”"
                            }
                        ]
